    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92160" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥαμψός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥαιβός</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥᾶνα:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρνα, Ῥωμαῖοι δὲ βάτραχον</span>, Id.
		(cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥήν</span>, also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ϝρᾶνον</span> [cod. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρανόν]:
			ἑξαμηνιαῖον πρόβατον</span>, Id.). <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥανᾶται:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλανᾶται, σπείρεται</span>, Id.</div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
